{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": false,\n  \"problems\": [\n    \"第6项硬性不通过。M3原话中的“有一件事”被改成“这份亲切”，末尾的“这份在意”也被改成“这份亲切”。前一处把候选原本没有明确指定的对象直接定性，后一处则改变了原句所指的心理对象；这不只是补指代、删重复或前后拼接。尤其是把“面对这份在意”改成“面对这份亲切”，使原本关于他自身在意什么的表述变成了面对一份亲切感，改变了原话的语义。即使整体解释连贯，也必须判不合格。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"reason\": \"M3与M8的因果链基本成立：对一件重要之事缺乏把握，可以解释郑重之下的失落与孤独；熟悉的旧场景又使期待和失落同时出现。S01-B3作为同一不确定处境的身体化侧面，也可以相容保留，不必另造昏迷或创伤前史。但候选原话被实质性改写，违反硬性第6项，因此整体不合格。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa30844c-a372-4b54-8cbb-2bf335ae2874", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261027T232902110118Z", "elapsed_seconds": 319.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-27T23:34:21.989688+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67675d09ff6c3ab808e58b69224a47c03c4c4053e5410e7c95fdf2612cdd8e03", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.